%% One Wayfinder phase handoff: from command to persisted artifact and back.
%% Sources live at diagrams/wayfinder/ and render to packages/wayfinder/assets/.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Coord as WayfinderCoordinator (authority)
    participant Store as Artifact store (state.json + Markdown)
    participant Child as Fresh child session (one agent + mapped skills)
    participant Next as Next phase child session

    User->>Coord: /wayfinder:next [change]
    Coord->>Coord: load agent definition and every mapped skill
    Coord->>Child: create capability-narrowed session
    Note over Child: one phase, one result schema, no delegation
    Child-->>Coord: one phase-specific JSON result

    alt Valid and complete result
        Coord->>Coord: validate against the phase schema
        Coord->>Store: render Markdown artifact (atomic replace)
        Coord->>Store: update state.json (atomic replace)
        Coord-->>User: phase complete, next action
        Store-->>Next: persisted artifacts as phase context
    else Malformed, partial, or turn-limited
        Coord->>Coord: reject and keep state unchanged
        Coord-->>User: retry the same phase after fixing the cause
    end
